jobs.description:
Would you like to contribute to flawless mail delivery and are you looking for a flexible part-time job? Become a mail preparer at our client in Assen! In this role, you will be responsible for ensuring that mail is correctly sorted and prepared for dispatch.

As a mail preparer in Assen, you are responsible for accurately sorting incoming mail. You will check addresses and shipping details and use various mail processing machines to handle the mail efficiently. The job requires precision and good physical condition, as you will be working primarily on your feet. You should also be open to working overtime to assist your colleagues during backlogs or busy periods.

What we ask for:

- No minimum educational requirements;
- Precision and attention to detail;
- Enthusiastic and motivated attitude;
- You speak either Dutch or English;
- Availability for 3 days, between Monday to Thursday.

SamenvattingAre you handy, do you enjoy working with electronics, and do you have an eye for quality? Then we are looking for production employees in Bleiswijk to help dismantle, clean, test, and assemble returned products. Good work!Over de functieIn this role, you will work with returned equipment and be responsible for:
dismantling modems, routers, and components;
cleaning parts and devices;
testing components and complete products;
assembling refurbished devices;
accurately recording test results.

At this company, you will work from Monday to Friday, from 07:30 to 16:30.
Over het bedrijfThe company you will be working for provides integrated logistics solutions with a strong focus on sustainability and circularity. They process returns efficiently and help customers maximize the value and usability of their devices.
Wat wij vragenYou are energetic and able to stay on your feet throughout a full working day;
You have an interest in electronics and technical tasks;
You have a good command of English;
You work accurately and perform well in a team.

Wat wij biedenAn attractive gross hourly wage of €15.26;
8.33% holiday allowance and 25 paid vacation days per year;
Travel allowance of €0.23 per kilometre;
A strong chance of receiving a permanent contract after 6 months;
Realistic opportunities for growth and development;
A pleasant working environment within a fast-growing organisation.

Meer informatieAre you ready to start as a production employee in Bleiswijk? You can apply in as little as 2 minutes.
Do you have any questions? Our team will be happy to assist you at +31 10 322 0177 or via denhaag-west@carriere.com

Are you an avid cleaner or cleaner? Do you want to make sure that vacationing guests can start their vacation with a good feeling? Then read on quickly! 

We are looking for part-time cleaning employees for vacation park de Leistert in Roggel. Mondays and Fridays are the so-called changeover days when new guests arrive at the cottage. On these days it is important that the bungalows and vacation homes are cleaned properly. You do this with a whole team of enthusiastic and motivated cleaners. Together you make sure that everything looks spic and span. 

Tasks you will perform include:

- Making beds;
- Cleaning the kitchen, bathroom, bedroom and living room;
- Dusting and mopping everything; 
- Identifying defects and passing them on to the right people so that they can be repaired in a timely manner.

The work takes place on Mondays and Fridays between 9 a.m. and 3 p.m. Would you like to work more? Please let us know so we can discuss the possibilities! 

- You are a motivated cleaner who knows how to get things done;
- You speak the Dutch, English or German language;
- It is no problem to come to the location in Roggel (public transport is also possible); 
- You are available at least on Mondays and Fridays.

In the vacation periods it is always extra busy, it is important that you are flexible in these periods!
